From: OpenWrt developers <openwrt-devel@lists.openwrt.org>
Subject: [PATCH] pkgconfig: derive include and library paths from prefix

OpenWrt's pkg-config wrapper relocates prefix into the target staging tree.
Absolute includedir/libdir entries bypass that relocation and point media-driver
at host headers. Keep the generated metadata relative to prefix.

--- a/Source/GmmLib/igdgmm.pc.in
+++ b/Source/GmmLib/igdgmm.pc.in
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 prefix=@CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX@
 execprefix=${prefix}
-includedir=@CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_INCLUDEDIR@/igdgmm
-libdir=@CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_LIBDIR@
+includedir=${prefix}/@CMAKE_INSTALL_INCLUDEDIR@/igdgmm
+libdir=${execprefix}/@CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR@
 
 Name: igdgmm
 Description: Intel(R) Graphics Memory Management Library
